  state "S-D03-035-01 정상" as normal
  state "S-D03-035-02 이탈확정" as confirmed
  state "S-D03-035-03 선택대기" as choice
  state "S-D03-035-04 재탐색중" as reroute
  state "S-D03-035-05 새경로" as installed
