  [*] --> normal
  normal --> confirmed: 2 distinct offroute fixes within 10s
  confirmed --> choice: latch and REROUTE token
  choice --> choice: recheck or later in route fix keeps latch
  choice --> reroute: exact token NEW_ROUTE
  reroute --> choice: failure retains route and suspension
  reroute --> installed: validated current response installed
  choice --> ended: exact token END
  installed --> normal: new route revision
